WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.610
Dvin stood on the plain of Ayrarat,

2
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.521
about thirty-five kilometers
south of modern Yerevan.

3
00:00:08.561 --> 00:00:12.591
By the sixth century
it was the seat of the catholicos,

4
00:00:12.631 --> 00:00:14.735
head of the Armenian Church.

5
00:00:15.095 --> 00:00:18.034
Far to the south
a new power had risen.

6
00:00:18.074 --> 00:00:19.904
Under the caliph Umar,

7
00:00:19.944 --> 00:00:23.264
Arab armies conquered
Syria and Mesopotamia,

8
00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:27.524
and in 640 the first of them
came north into Armenia.

9
00:00:27.884 --> 00:00:32.574
Theodoros Rshtuni,
commander of the Armenian forces,

10
00:00:32.614 --> 00:00:34.426
took the field against them.

11
00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:36.156
But a maneuver went wrong,

12
00:00:36.196 --> 00:00:38.188
and the raiders reached Dvin.

13
00:00:38.548 --> 00:00:41.780
They took the capital
despite a stubborn defense.

14
00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:45.330
The Armenian histories tell
of thirty-five thousand

15
00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:47.170
carried into captivity.

16
00:00:47.491 --> 00:00:49.781
It was a raid, not yet a conquest,

17
00:00:49.821 --> 00:00:51.621
and Dvin rose again.

18
00:00:51.906 --> 00:00:55.069
Now the raiders come down
both roads at once.

19
00:00:55.429 --> 00:00:58.315
Man the walls.

